  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to WFP&apos;s Grain from Ukraine Initiative 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Tuki WFP:n Viljaa Ukrainasta - hankkeelle 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry for Foreign Affairs supports the World Food Programme&apos;s (WFP) Grain from Ukraine Initiative with 1 million euros. With Finland&apos;s support, WFP will buy grain from Ukraine and transport it to countries that are struggling with food insecurity in Africa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Ulkoministeri&#xf6; my&#xf6;nt&#xe4;&#xe4; 1 miljoonaa euroa humanitaarista apua Maailman ruokaohjelman (World Food Programme, WFP) toimeenpanemalle Viljaa Ukrainasta -hankkeelle (Grain From Ukraine Initiative). Suomen tuella WFP ostaa viljaa Ukrainasta ja vie sit&#xe4; ruokakriisist&#xe4; k&#xe4;rsiviin maihin Afrikassa.</narrative>
  </description>
